nselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo accent=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> So, the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"105\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-axis is the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"106\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"border: solid 1pt gainsboro;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 4.473em; margin: 0.4em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.4em; top: 0px; max-width: 4.473em;\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c62\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle style=\"border: solid 1pt gainsboro\"><mpadded height=\"+4pt\" depth=\"+4pt\" lspace=\"4pt\" width=\"+8pt\"><mtext>unstable</mtext></mpadded></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> line.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Eigenvalue <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"107\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D706 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> with the eigenvector <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"108\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B TEX-S3\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 0.5em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-top: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D TEX-S3\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> The corresponding straight-line solutions of the form\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"109\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D450 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D452 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mrow space=\"2\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B TEX-S3\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 0.5em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-top: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D TEX-S3\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nlie on the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"110\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-axis and also move away from the origin as <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"111\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2192\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo accent=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> So, the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"112\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-axis is the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"113\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"border: solid 1pt gainsboro;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 4.473em; margin: 0.4em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.4em; top: 0px; max-width: 4.473em;\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c62\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle style=\"border: solid 1pt gainsboro\"><mpadded height=\"+4pt\" depth=\"+4pt\" lspace=\"4pt\" width=\"+8pt\"><mtext>unstable</mtext></mpadded></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> line.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the equilibrium point (origin) is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"114\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"border: solid 1pt gainsboro;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 11.843em; margin: 0.4em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.4em; top: 0px; max-width: 11.843em;\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c20\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c62\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c20\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c20\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle style=\"border: solid 1pt gainsboro\"><mpadded height=\"+4pt\" depth=\"+4pt\" lspace=\"4pt\" width=\"+8pt\"><mtext>an unstable node (source)</mtext></mpadded></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> The phase portrait of the system looks as follows:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-80afef319535c73c8d64140c59de460c\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/80afef319535c73c8d64140c59de460c\"></div></div></div>",
